    "title": "乃木坂46中国会员站先行入会特典",
    "slug": "46",
    "content": "<p>本次准备了各位成员亲笔签名的明信片。</p>\n<p>于本站上线后3日内（<strong>中国时间：2019年12月24日 16:00~2019年12月27日16:00</strong>）加入乃木坂46中国会员站并成为正式会员的用户，将有机会获得乃木坂46成员亲笔签名的明信片一份，我们将随机抽取正式会员进行赠送。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>*在中国时间2019年12月27日16:00之后成为正式会员的用户将不具备先行入会特典抽选资格。</p>\n<p>*请各位用户在注册时填写准确地址。</p>\n<p>*本活动有可能未经预告进行变更。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img title=\"先行入会特典Sample\" src=\"/storage/blog_posts/December2019/postcard sample.png\" alt=\"Postcard Sample\" width=\"380\" height=\"579\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; *图片仅供参考，请以实物为准。</p>",
